# FR-R3-090 (SUP-01) — third-party lifecycle scripts do not run on install, by
# default rather than by a contributor remembering a flag.
#
# The webview half. The hardening used to live in the workflow files as
# `npm --prefix webview-ui ci --ignore-scripts`; Actions were retired on
# 2026-08-26 by operator decision (`FR-R3-099`) and those files were deleted, so
# this file and the root `.npmrc` are the only authority left. CONTRIBUTING.md
# names the same command as a declared step.
#
# The webview tree declares no lifecycle script of its own; this file exists so a
# contributor who installs it directly gets the same posture as one who follows
# the two-command sequence.
#
# tests/lint/install-flag-parity.test.ts reads this file and the documents that
# teach the install sequence, and fails if they disagree — or if a workflow
# directory reappears to become a second authority again.
ignore-scripts=true
